   "source": [
    "## Summary\n",
    "\n",
    "- Use `np.fromfile()` to read binary data with the correct dtype.\n",
    "- Interleaved I/Q data must be reshaped and converted to complex.\n",
    - Always validate loaded data: check shape, dtype, and basic statistics.\n",
    "- Common mistakes include wrong dtype, missing interleave conversion, and byte order issues."
   ]
  }
